# Realistic Uncertainty Scenario: Ad Hoc Rules in CulinaryControlEnv.create_custom_recipe

## Uncertainty Manifestation: Ingredient Quantity Format Requirements

**Description**:
The API enforces strict formatting rules for ingredient quantities that deviate from intuitive expectations. All ingredient quantities must follow a specific pattern: numeric value followed by a standardized unit abbreviation without spaces. For example, "2cups" instead of "2 cups" or "1/2tsp" instead of "1/2 teaspoon". The API rejects any quantities that don't follow this exact format, causing recipe creation to fail with a cryptic error message.

